    {
      "id": "claim_e5a6d7db15924bce9b7b35cdaae8eb69",
      "statement": "The Tool interface is ID/Permission/Patterns/External/Schema/Desc/Run; Patterns and External receive raw args only (no Env) and emit paths as given (the engine resolves them against Env.Dir), Run receives *Env (session project dir as permission anchor + base for relative paths, session shell, output limits, OutputDir, session storage, session id, logger) and returns Output (Title for the TUI, Text for the model, Meta for TUI display metadata); Registry() returns the built-ins keyed by ID, Visible filters out tools the ruleset hides (permission.Hidden), and SchemaFor renders the type:function tool-call schema; output limits default to 2000 lines / 50 KiB mirroring upstream truncate.ts.",
      "evidence": [
        {
          "resource": "repo://internal/tool/tool.go#L16-L139",
          "version": "repo-lines-v1:sha256:b1c3b01fb55a594ec2a694317e1f0fae0a6644fbf124a38bba6577c67294c7a9:"
        }
