    {
      "id": "claim_8ae33b6acdaa43aa823c4562ec437a1b",
      "statement": "Truncate keeps the TAIL of the text (the last up-to MaxLines lines within MaxBytes UTF-8 bytes, a port of upstream shell.ts tail() including the UTF-8-boundary cut of a single over-long line) and returns cut when anything was removed; WriteFullOutput writes the untruncated output to dir/tool_<id> (the data dir's tool-output/) returning the path (an empty dir returns empty so the caller skips the marker); when cut, the model-visible text is prefixed with '...output truncated...\\n\\nFull output saved to: <path>\\n\\n' and meta[outputPath] is set; CleanOutputDir removes tool_* outputs older than OutputDirRetention (7 days), a missing dir is a no-op, and v1 runs the sweep once at startup (cmd/yolo/deps.go, best-effort) rather than upstream's hourly.",
