      "id": "claim_f86cfdb9841e4f098a5258168baa06c5",
      "statement": "Every tool's description is an embedded, sha256-pinned text file loaded via //go:embed desc/<tool>.txt; because the installed toolchains fail a plain import \"embed\" + scalar embed with 'embed imported and not used', the in-repo workaround is import _ \"embed\" (seen in read.go and every other tool file); the pins record current intended content, not an upstream lock, and an intentional change re-baselines the sha256 pin in the same commit.",
